# =============================================================================
# SyncFlow — Environment Configuration Reference
# =============================================================================
# This file documents ALL environment variables used by SyncFlow.
#
# For deployment, create the actual .env files:
#   Backend:  cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   Frontend: cp web/.env.example web/.env
#
# Backend variables (backend/.env):
#   NODE_ENV              - environment (development | production)
#   PORT                  - server port (default: 5000)
#   MONGODB_URI           - MongoDB connection string
#   JWT_SECRET            - JWT signing secret (min 32 chars)
#   JWT_REFRESH_SECRET    - JWT refresh secret (min 32 chars)
#   JWT_EXPIRY            - access token expiry (default: 15m)
#   JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRY    - refresh token expiry (default: 7d)
#   ENCRYPTION_KEY        - encryption key (min 32 chars)
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID      - Google OAuth client ID
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET  - Google OAuth client secret
#   GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI   - Google OAuth callback (required in production)
#   EMAIL_REDIRECT_URI    - Gmail email OAuth callback (required in production)
#   CORS_ORIGIN           - Comma-separated allowed origins (required in production)
#   RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS  - Rate limit window (default: 60000)
#   RATE_LIMIT_MAX        - Rate limit max requests (default: 200)
#   APP_URL               - Public app URL (required in production)
#
# Frontend variables (web/.env / Cloudflare Pages env vars):
#   VITE_API_URL          - Backend API base URL (default: /api)
#
# See backend/.env.example and web/.env.example for full details.
